    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "f3275b43-4ac6-4cab-9b75-ac6f6c06c661",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "BCR Vol. 107 - Narnia No More",
        "Location": "LOCATION_GOLDEN_GECKO",
        "PublicId": "127971949233",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository db2c6865-6d78-47d6-973a-3afc15375f04).Image",
        "Description": "Hello Agents,\rgood to see you! Have you heard the recent news?\rBox, Closet &amp; Beyond has made an update to all its furnitures.\rApparently they are running low on money and have decided to no longer build their containers with bullet proof materials, even the metal ones! Quite the fortunate turn of events for our business I would say. Say why don&apos;t you go out and test this new change in a productive environment. While you&apos;re at it, try to see how explosions react to them. Good luck!\rBy Celllie",
